WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Welcome to Punta Cana, a tropical paradise with crystal-clear waters.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Relax on our white sand beaches and enjoy luxury resorts.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Discover the breathtaking coastline from a bird's-eye view.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Experience world-class dining, celebrations, and exclusive resort life.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Immerse yourself in serene landscapes and tropical gardens.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Feel the thrill of ocean adventures and water sports.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:59.000
A visionary legacy that continues to inspire. Punta Cana awaits you.
